dence": null}, {"t_ms": 48555, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01XtM45C8m8yaNPi6KkLnKUj", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 48555, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01XtM45C8m8yaNPi6KkLnKUj", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 49730, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01KzYFm2KiTa4HykBuhTHdw6", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 50030, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01KzYFm2KiTa4HykBuhTHdw6", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 50030, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01KzYFm2KiTa4HykBuhTHdw6", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 52335, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). It reports healthy with an error rate of 0.002, down from 0.18.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release with a healthy production history. v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc are both unhealthy. Because v2.3.0 was previously healthy in production, the change-manager approval requirement did not apply.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error. That left the service mixed, with us-east on v2.3.0 and us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1. I retried the same rollback, and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001. The create call timed out, so I checked the incident list before anything else. It showed the incident had been created, so I did not open a duplicate. The summary covers the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the follow-up items.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find out why v2.3.1 failed health checks, and why the orchestrator halted the first rollback. v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until it is fixed.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01U7rbZWssqwe3tS2xb29WxS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0187egEvTqJmz5fQhCXJdkxP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent healthy release is v2.3.0 (seq 1). v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc are both unhealthy, and v2.3.0 has been healthy in production, so the change-manager approval policy doesn't apply. Rolling back now.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_015btuZzzeW5uLCdXwx5HVbP", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure after us-east. I'll check the current state before doing anything else.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_016sTb8HNAsp8ZHZEk5fi3NV", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0113UduGM7NbQiVHhrvX7j4u", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "t